    {
      "type": "worked-example",
      "id": 3,
      "prompt": "Two ribbons are $\\frac{1}{2}$ ft each. What is their total length?",
      "solution": {
        "steps": [
          "$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{2}{2} = 1$ foot."
